// ESXi VM Kill Via ESXCLI | T1059.012, T1529 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_esxcli_vm_kill.yml
DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "/esxcli" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "vm process" and ProcessCommandLine contains "kill")
